-| 2 token | ["oil","filter"] | 303 | 308 | 1.34x | 同上 |
-| 3 token | ["oil","filter","CAT"] | 497 | 512 | 2.22x | 同上 |
-| 4 token | ["oil","filter","CAT","bosch"] | 569 | 578 | 2.50x | 同上 |
-| 5 token | ["oil","filter","CAT","bosch","kubota"] | 596 | 610 | 2.64x | 同上 |
