+  - SanitizeToken 递归处理 _formatted 高亮字段时, arr[i] = SanitizeToken(arr[i]) 当递归返回同一节点 (字符串未变化), JsonArray.SetItem 尝试重新设置 parent 抛 "The node already has a parent"; 修复为 if (sanitized != arr[i]) arr[i] = sanitized 只在值变化时赋值
